[1] E2-h self-drag: G_gamma = 1/(k^2 - w^2/c^2 - i gamma w/c^2), source moving at v (w = k.v)
    F = -4 pi G int d^3k/(2pi)^3 k Im[k^2 G] |rho~|^2/k^2 ; first order: Gamma = 2 gamma |U|/(3 M c^2)
    gamma=1e-03, v=1e-02 (c=1, a=1): exact Gamma = 1.496739e-05, 2 gamma|U|/(3Mc^2) = 1.496559e-05, ratio = 1.000120
    gamma=1e-04, v=1e-03 (c=1, a=1): exact Gamma = 1.496561e-06, 2 gamma|U|/(3Mc^2) = 1.496559e-06, ratio = 1.000001
    gamma=1e-02, v=1e-01 (c=1, a=1): exact Gamma = 1.512685e-04, 2 gamma|U|/(3Mc^2) = 1.496559e-04, ratio = 1.010775
    subtraction: none (odd part of the response only)

