    linear: Gamma_A=1.2e-05, Gamma_B=8.0e-06, V=[0.3, 0.2, 0.1], e=0.088: Pdot/P = -2.9737e-05; -3 Gamma_eff (mass-weighted) = -2.9793e-05; ratio 0.9981
    cubic F = -m G3 |u|^2 u, V=[0.0, 0.0, 0.0], e=0.0: Pdot/P = -7.5268e-06; -3 G3 <V^2+V_par^2+w^2>_m = -7.5268e-06; ratio 1.0000
    cubic F = -m G3 |u|^2 u, V=[0.8, 0.0, 0.0], e=0.0: Pdot/P = -4.5670e-05; -3 G3 <V^2+V_par^2+w^2>_m = -4.5927e-05; ratio 0.9944
    cubic F = -m G3 |u|^2 u, V=[0.0, 0.0, 0.8], e=0.0: Pdot/P = -2.6641e-05; -3 G3 <V^2+V_par^2+w^2>_m = -2.6727e-05; ratio 0.9968
    cubic F = -m G3 |u|^2 u, V=[0.8, 0.0, 0.0], e=0.088: Pdot/P = -4.5867e-05; -3 G3 <V^2+V_par^2+w^2>_m = -4.5927e-05; ratio 0.9987
    => Pdot_b/P_b = -3 Gamma_eff for linear drag (any V, small e; unequal Gamma mass-weighted); cubic drag: Gamma_eq = Gamma_3 (V^2 + V_par^2 + w^2): the CMB velocity enters

[4] repair 'the same way': friction memory kernel with zero integral, K(t) = g0[delta(t) - wc e^{-wc t}] theta(t)
    gamma(w) = int K e^{iwt} dt = g0 (-i w)/(wc - i w);  Re gamma = g0 w^2/(w^2 + wc^2) >= 0 (passive); gamma(0) = 0
    zeroth moment of K (wc=2): -2.2e-16; min Re gamma over w in [-1e3,1e3]: 0.0e+00
    rest frame: max Im w over k in [1e-4,1e4], g0 in {1e-3,0.1,10}, wc in {1e-2,1,1e2}: -5.00e-16 (<= 0: no growth)
    boosted frames (6000 random beta<0.999, k', g0, wc): max Im w' = -2.22e-13 (<= 0 within rounding: no growing mode)
    check: ohmic polytrope Gamma/gamma (quadrature) = 0.08233; 2|U|/(3Mc^2) with |U| = 3GM^2/(4R): 0.08234
    double pulsar, n=1 polytropes R = 12 km, V_CMB = 370 km/s in the orbital plane (worst case):
      wc =       0 rad/s: Gamma_eq(g0 = H0) = 1.75e-19 s^-1 (V normal to plane 1.75e-19); bound 6.12e-21 -> g0 < 0.035 H0
      wc =      30 rad/s: Gamma_eq(g0 = H0) = 1.04e-19 s^-1 (V normal to plane 9.23e-20); bound 6.12e-21 -> g0 < 0.0591 H0
      wc =     100 rad/s: Gamma_eq(g0 = H0) = 4.10e-20 s^-1 (V normal to plane 3.16e-20); bound 6.12e-21 -> g0 < 0.149 H0
      wc =     300 rad/s: Gamma_eq(g0 = H0) = 8.40e-21 s^-1 (V normal to plane 5.62e-21); bound 6.12e-21 -> g0 < 0.729 H0
      wc =    1000 rad/s: Gamma_eq(g0 = H0) = 8.75e-22 s^-1 (V normal to plane 5.56e-22); bound 6.12e-21 -> g0 < 7 H0
      wc =    3000 rad/s: Gamma_eq(g0 = H0) = 9.88e-23 s^-1 (V normal to plane 6.24e-23); bound 6.12e-21 -> g0 < 62 H0
    wc = 300: friction left in the LIGO band gamma(w)/g0 = 0.149 (20 Hz), 0.814 (100 Hz), 0.998 (1 kHz); on near-cone record modes w = c/l >= 6e13 rad/s: 1 - gamma/g0 <= 2e-23
    wc = 1000: friction left in the LIGO band gamma(w)/g0 = 0.016 (20 Hz), 0.283 (100 Hz), 0.975 (1 kHz); on near-cone record modes w = c/l >= 6e13 rad/s: 1 - gamma/g0 <= 3e-22
    subtraction: none

