[6] near-cone record budget on equal terms
    (a) E2 single-port causal factor: H_g(w) = (W^2 - w^2 - i g w)^(-1/2) <-> theta(t) e^{-g t/2} J0(W' t), W' = sqrt(W^2 - g^2/4)
