      w=0.97: Laplace of e^(-gt/2)J0 = 2.586952+1.453124j; (W^2-w^2-igw)^(-1/2) = 2.586952+1.453124j
      w=1.0: Laplace of e^(-gt/2)J0 = 2.236068+2.236068j; (W^2-w^2-igw)^(-1/2) = 2.236068+2.236068j
      w=1.5: Laplace of e^(-gt/2)J0 = 0.053188+0.889647j; (W^2-w^2-igw)^(-1/2) = 0.053188+0.889647j
      branch points (zeros of W^2 - w^2 - i g w): 0.9987-0.0500j, -0.9987-0.0500j (both Im < 0: H_g and 1/H_g analytic in the UHP, outer)
    (b) Var h per mode (W = 1): E1 finite age 1/2 int_0^T J0^2 vs E2 stationary 1/2 int_0^inf e^{-g t} J0(W' t)^2 dt
      g = 1e-02: E2 Var h = 1.063895; E1 Var h at T_eq = e^(-gamma_E)/g = 56.15: 1.062924; asymptote ln(8/g)/(2pi) = 1.063889
      g = 1e-03: E2 Var h = 1.430357; E1 Var h at T_eq = e^(-gamma_E)/g = 561.5: 1.430385; asymptote ln(8/g)/(2pi) = 1.430357
      g = 3e-04: E2 Var h = 1.621975; E1 Var h at T_eq = e^(-gamma_E)/g = 1872: 1.621981; asymptote ln(8/g)/(2pi) = 1.621975
